title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file:trash
catalog: GUI command
target: file:trash
summary: Send a panel's files to the trash, metarecords with them (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``ctrl+delete`` → ``file:trash self`` (in the ``metarecord-detail`` panel)
* ``ctrl+delete`` → ``file:trash self`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
